    "updated_at": "2017-04-19T07:58:34Z",
    "body": "Note: I've got an easier-to-spec/explain implementation queued up for `-webkit-gradient(linear, ...)` in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1241623\r\n\r\nIt looks like that spelling of the webkit prefixed gradients is not yet mentioned in the compat spec (but should be included, eventually -- I guess that's why this issue is open & not closed).",
